    narr:narration """The organization's calibration activities center on the [Kestrelwood spectrograph](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4), which has been set to a specific frequency of 88.4 MHz. This technical specification is supported by [verification against June reference plates](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2), a process that confirms stability across the instrument's observing band. These findings are being transitioned from operational data into [ratified decision records](narr:Narrative_CalibrationDecisionRecord), formalizing the calibration as a baseline for subsequent work. While the technical execution is framed through [direct expert claims](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1), the documentation process shifts toward a [structured, matter-of-fact reporting style](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3) intended to guide broader organizational action.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_CalibrationDecisionRecord> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerification> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Kestrelwood spectrograph is now calibrated at 88.4 MHz." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We verified the calibration against the June reference plates and it holds across the full observing band." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Settled calibration decisions recorded as ratified items" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_CalibrationDecisionRecord> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "- **Calibration**: 88.4 MHz, verified against June reference plates" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The tension between technical, expert-led reporting and the administrative formalization of these results into ratified, matter-of-fact records." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
